      "content": "\"decide how you will meet that ending...\" \n\nYou mean it, don't you? To avoid the chains, to avoid the shame of being dragged through the mud by the enemy... maybe there's more dignity in choosing the moment myself. Is it truly more honorable to die by one's own hand than to let them take me like a beast?",
